#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_queue/mail_queue.json
msgid ""
"Provide a JSON array of objects with display_name and email. <br>\n"
"Example: <code>[{\"display_name\": \"Jane Smith\", \"email\": \"jane@example.com\"}]</code>"
msgstr ""
"Fournissez un tableau JSON d'objets avec display_name et email. <br>\n"
"Exemple : <code>[{\"display_name\": \"Jane Smith\", \"email\": \"jane@example.com\"}]</code>"

#. Description of the 'Recipients' (JSON) field in DocType 'Mail Queue'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_queue/mail_queue.json
msgid ""
"Provide a JSON array of recipients with type, display_name, and email. <br>\n"
"<b>type</b> must be \"To\", \"Cc\", or \"Bcc\". <br>\n"
"Example: <code>[{\"type\": \"To\", \"display_name\": \"Jane Smith\", \"email\": \"jane@example.com\"}]</code>"
msgstr ""
"Fournissez un tableau JSON de destinataires avec type, display_name et email. <br>\n"
"<b>type</b> doit être \"To\", \"Cc\" ou \"Bcc\". <br>\n"
"Exemple : <code>[{\"type\": \"To\", \"display_name\": \"Jane Smith\", \"email\": \"jane@example.com\"}]</code>"

#. Description of the 'Attachments' (JSON) field in DocType 'Mail Queue'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_queue/mail_queue.json
msgid ""
"Provide a JSON array with file_url, disposition (inline or attachment), and cid. <br>\n"
"Example: <code>[{\"file_url\": \"/private/files/image.png\", \"disposition\": \"inline\", \"cid\": \"j80BhiEC5o\"}]</code>"
msgstr ""
"Fournissez un tableau JSON avec file_url, disposition (inline ou attachment) et cid. <br>\n"
"Exemple : <code>[{\"file_url\": \"/private/files/image.png\", \"disposition\": \"inline\", \"cid\": \"j80BhiEC5o\"}]</code>"

#. Description of the 'Headers' (JSON) field in DocType 'Mail Queue'
#: suite/mail/doctype/mail_queue/mail_queue.json
msgid ""
"Provide a JSON object with header name–value pairs. <br>\n"
"Example: <code>{\"X-Custom-Header\": \"Value\"}</code>"
msgstr ""
"Fournissez un objet JSON avec des paires nom-valeur d'en-têtes. <br>\n"
"Exemple : <code>{\"X-Custom-Header\": \"Value\"}</code>"

